                                                "text": "Hits were observed, but again the poor functioning of VT ammunition hindered in effecting a splash."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b43ef685-b34d-38e1-9f80-c0dad6ba386d",
